{"name":"Inked","hex":"#3b5066","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"inked","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a tattoo or tattoos."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of ink"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/inked"}],"entries":[{"title":"Inked (magazine)","blocks":[{"text":"Inked is a tattoo lifestyle digital and print media company that bills itself as the outsiders' insider media. Covering music, fashion, art, sports and the rest of the lifestyle of the tattooed, Inked, like Vice, has evolved from newsstands to a large-scale digital media company. Tattooed women like Kat Von D, Avril Lavigne, Diablo Cody, Eve and Malin Akerman have appeared on Inked's cover. Among the celebrities who have sat down with Inked are Ozzy Osbourne, Lil Pump, Tracy Morgan, Slash, Kid Cudi and Billie Joe Armstrong. Inked also covers tattoo artists; they immortalize the best in their Icon feature through which the likes of Don Ed Hardy, Horiyoshi III and Ami James have been honored."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b5/Inked_%28magazine%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inked_(magazine)","wikidata":"Q10302260"},{"title":"Inked (video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Inked: A Tale of Love is a puzzle-platform game developed by Somnium Games and published by Starbreeze Publishing for Microsoft Windows. It was demoed at the 2016 Reboot Infogamer convention in Zagreb and released on 26 April 2018 via Steam. An iOS and Android version was released in February 2021. Versions for Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4 and Xbox One published by Pixmain were later released on 27 August 2021."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/ee/InkedGameCover.jpg/330px-InkedGameCover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inked_(video_game)","wikidata":"Q55614476"}],"images":[],"sounds":{"inked":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/En-au-inked.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/30/En-au-inked.ogg/En-au-inked.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Banknote portrait pattern (Intaglio print, tactile effect)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Banknote_portrait_pattern_%28Intaglio_print%2C_tactile_effect%29.jpg/500px-Banknote_portrait_pattern_%28Intaglio_print%2C_tactile_effect%29.jpg","ratio":1.3387860525182953,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Banknote_portrait_pattern_(Intaglio_print,_tactile_effect).jpg","share":0.170625},{"title":"Lake Geneva from Chillon Castle","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/17/Lake_Geneva_from_Chillon_Castle.jpg/500px-Lake_Geneva_from_Chillon_Castle.jpg","ratio":1.4998620689655173,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lake_Geneva_from_Chillon_Castle.jpg","share":0.14875},{"title":"Gold coloured ink on paper electron micrograph 01","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/00/Gold_coloured_ink_on_paper_electron_micrograph_01.jpg/500px-Gold_coloured_ink_on_paper_electron_micrograph_01.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gold_coloured_ink_on_paper_electron_micrograph_01.jpg","share":0.1125},{"title":"Ink cartridge","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b5/Ink_cartridge.jpg/500px-Ink_cartridge.jpg","ratio":0.750191570881226,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ink_cartridge.jpg","share":0.11125},{"title":"11-tattoo inks and needle cartridge are set up on tray","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/11-tattoo_inks_and_needle_cartridge_are_set_up_on_tray.jpg/500px-11-tattoo_inks_and_needle_c